==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Berserkory]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Berserkory]] spawns after 27.33 seconds<sup>820f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns.

==Strategy==
One of the harder stages out of the three; you definitely want to fight close to the base if you wish to not rely on specific Ubers. You may want to use a [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shield Cat]] to defend against the Berserkories combined with any high damage [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cat]] to deal with the entire stage overall; however, depending on the quality of the Wave Shield used, it might be better to use [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] and a [[:Category:Cats with Wave Immunity|Wave Immune Cat]] instead, namely [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Neo Cutter Cat]] (if available in True Form), as he outranges the Berserkories.

